US-081 is not complete, so I am not signalling COMPLETE. The documentation and most gates are done, but several acceptance items need hardware or decisions that aren't available on this machine.

**Confirmed on this machine:**
- `/dev/dri` is absent, so there is no native Linux Vulkan device for the GPU suite.
